Ancient City Malhar

Malhar__ rich soil has witnessed the reign of many mighty kings and supreme dynasties. It has seen the rise &amp; the fall of kingdoms, the proof of which is buried in its soil. Excavations shows the early habitation starting from 2nd century BC

